            "question": "Are ZINARA lab grown diamonds graded and certified?",
            "answer": "Yes, lab grown diamonds are graded and certified by the same gemological laboratories that evaluate natural diamonds. Renowned organizations like GIA, IGI, and SGL provide these certifications. The grading process for lab grown diamonds is identical to that for natural diamonds, ensuring transparency and quality assurance. All lab grown diamonds used in jewellery offered by ZINARA are graded and certified by these laboratory organizations."
